Fan-Art & Intellectual Property Notice / 同人二创免责声明
------------------------------------------------------------------------
The PCB artworks and designs in this repository include fan-made tributes
inspired by characters and in-game props from "Genshin Impact" (miHoYo /
HoYoverse) and "Delta Force" (Team Jade / Tencent). All original game
characters, names, emblems, and IP rights belong to their respective
copyright holders.

All files in this repository are unofficial fan creations shared strictly
for personal learning, collection, and non-commercial DIY PCB prototyping.
Commercial manufacturing, resale, or paid distribution is strictly
prohibited.
